 ## How it works
 **Inputs and Outputs:**
-*   **Input:** A set of 3D Gaussians defined by position $\mathbf{\mu}$, covariance $\mathbf{\Sigma}$ (or rotation $\mathbf{R}$ and scale $\mathbf{s}$), and a learned scalar density value $\sigma$ [G].
